#: ../../chapter03.rst:3
msgid "Initial Configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:5
msgid ""
"After the machine reboots, the Default administration configuration page "
"will be displayed."
msgstr "机器重启后，将显示默认管理配置页面。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:7
msgid "First, setup the cluster administrator account."
msgstr "首先，设置集群管理员账户。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:11
msgid ""
"After setting up the cluster administrator account, the cluster "
"administrator's dashboard will appear by default."
msgstr "设置集群管理员账户后，默认会显示集群管理员的仪表板。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:15
msgid ""
"Once you see the dashboard, the |prodname| side of the setup is finished "
"successfully. We will continue to check the storage configuration and "
"make sure all components are fully functional."
msgstr "一旦您看到仪表板，|prodname| 部分的设置就已成功完成。我们将继续检查存储配置，并确保所有组件都完全正常运行。"

